  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/DSC_0035.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px\" /></p>\n<p>El Coro de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda ha&nbsp;interpretado la tarde de este domingo por primera vez los Gozos al Salvador, en su ermita de Onda, conforme a la&nbsp;melod&iacute;a original, armonizada por Dani Catal&aacute;n D&aacute;vila, que tambi&eacute;n ha dirigido el conjunto vocal. Antes se hab&iacute;a inaugurado una exposici&oacute;n sobre figuras del &#39;Divino Infante&#39;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoinfantdiviiestrenapartituragojoselsalvador/dsc_0001.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoinfantdiviiestrenapartituragojoselsalvador/dsc_0002.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoinfantdiviiestrenapartituragojoselsalvador/dsc_0003.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoinfantdiviiestrenapartituragojoselsalvador/dsc_0005.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoinfantdiviiestrenapartituragojoselsalvador/dsc_0006.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoinfantdiviiestrenapartituragojoselsalvador/dsc_0007.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoinfantdiviiestrenapartituragojoselsalvador/dsc_0010.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ex